{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Illuminate or Perish</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GeoLight is a fast-paced arena roguelite where you wield light to fend off waves of geometric foes and grow stronger with every death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Core Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light-Based Combat \u2013 Fire beams, bursts, and area pulses. Dodge through shifting patterns.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable Runs \u2013 Choose your build: elemental lights, passive boosts, overdrives.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Waves \u2013 Unpredictable enemy formations and boss battles keep each run fresh.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metaprogress + Permadeath \u2013 Unlock new abilities and permanent upgrades across runs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Sessions, Deep Replay \u2013 Jump in for a few minutes or grind through intense wave sequences.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724020/ab9c957a4502e50a727e7d10f516f340afc56324.jpg"},{"name":"Amateur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724020/fae3862760f563dae95b5c89132dc7dd34607101.jpg"},{"name":"Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724020/2f25e9a97fd5b2ecaf9d52b9e6b8d8da74164f44.jpg"},{"name":"Intermediate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724020/dd405c67b771ac7f57df5e3c30888f66c9d43534.jpg"},{"name":"Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724020/94b21a7f8ee154545ab2fe11cd3e41768f86b928.jpg"},{"name":"First Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3724020/7e25658c04b307910cc4e7